{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/06/08/0674534/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/06/08/0674534/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NOGIビンゴ見てくださいましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回1期生から能條愛未、松村沙友理、和田まあやで参加させて頂きました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/06/08/0674534/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3期生の与田ちゃんがブルゾンちえみさん\nまっつんと私はwithBさんをやらせていただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まっつんと念入りに動画を見て楽屋で何度も練習して頑張りました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/06/08/0674534/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな時間がとても楽しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/06/08/0674534/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"与田ちゃんは恥ずかしい恥ずかしいと言ってて可愛いなぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/06/08/0674534/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って私達は見てました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/06/08/0674534/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/06/08/0674534/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてかりんと川後ちゃんとまあやでバナナゼロミュージックに出演させていただきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/06/08/0674534/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本番前スタジオ入ろうとしたら\n「わぁっ！！！！」\nって後ろからドンッ！ってされて自分でもビックリするぐらい驚いてしまって\n誰かと思ったらなんと設楽さんでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/06/08/0674534/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ビックリしすぎて「わー！」ってなった時\n自分の手を思いきり顔にぶつけてしまいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/06/08/0674534/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/06/08/0674534/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回もでしたが、今回もなかなか難しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/06/08/0674534/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもすごく楽しくてあっという間でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/06/08/0674534/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6月24日22時20分からですっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/06/08/0674534/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非見てねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/06/08/0674534/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/06/08/0674534/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして先日のRの法則見てくれたかな？\n今回はハチミツがテーマでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/06/08/0674534/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハチミツフォンデュで色々しましたが\n個人的には海鮮系はハチミツ似合わないなーと思いました！\nトマトは意外と美味しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/06/08/0674534/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハチミツテーマだったから黄色い服きた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/06/08/0674534/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10代の番組だし19歳の私は残りの期間、\nＲ'sとして頑張ります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてみりあとあやねとまあやで「のぎのの」したよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1期生の最年少と2期の最年少と絢音は〜なんだろ2期の最年少じゃないけど\nあやねもまあやと同じ年！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/06/08/0674534/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終始楽屋で話してる感覚の私たちでしたが私達は相当楽しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/06/08/0674534/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして次回の乃木坂工事中もみてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/06/08/0674534/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてレギュラー番組のぎえいごもお見逃し無く"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/06/08/0674534/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プライベートでもみんな仲いいからテレビ越しにも伝わってるんじゃないかな〜と思いますっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/06/08/0674534/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/06/08/0674534/0015.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都の個別握手会！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました！\nみんなの笑顔で私も更に笑顔になりました。いつも感謝しています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お外の天気がよかったからお外出たらその瞬間くもっちゃった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/06/08/0674534/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/06/08/0674534/0016.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"bye"}],"source":"archive"}